1
00:00:09,470 --> 00:00:13,200
Please stay safe, Rin, Shirou!

2
00:01:49,290 --> 00:01:50,940
Is that all you have?

3
00:01:51,670 --> 00:01:54,200
As I thought, you were a fake.

4
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:56,440
You are incapable of saving anything.

5
00:01:56,800 --> 00:02:00,400
That shabby Archer said as much, did he not?

6
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:03,030
That your ideals were not your own.

7
00:02:03,030 --> 00:02:10,660
I'm astonished that a man without a thing to call his own 
was arrogant enough to think he could accomplish anything.

8
00:02:11,010 --> 00:02:12,920
"Champion of justice"?

9
00:02:13,230 --> 00:02:15,670
"A world where no one is hurt"?

10
00:02:15,670 --> 00:02:18,040
Don't be absurd.

11
00:02:18,040 --> 00:02:22,550
"Humanity" is the name for beasts that cannot find joy in life without sacrifice.

12
00:02:23,290 --> 00:02:29,240
Your much-vaunted "equality" is nonsense spouted 
by weaklings who cannot bear to stare into the abyss.

13
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:32,770
It is naught but an excuse to cover up your own ugliness.

14
00:02:33,850 --> 00:02:36,260
Yeah, he's exactly right.

15
00:02:37,410 --> 00:02:39,600
My desires are borrowed.

16
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:44,380
A pretense I put on, copied from someone I once saw saving another.

17
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:48,700
When it happened, I was empty inside.

18
00:02:49,200 --> 00:02:51,330
Everyone was dying indiscriminately,

19
00:02:51,330 --> 00:02:53,830
and nobody looked to save anyone else.

20
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:57,340
If I hadn't resigned myself to the idea that that's how people are,

21
00:02:57,340 --> 00:03:00,210
I wouldn't have been able to keep on living.

22
00:03:01,600 --> 00:03:02,500
That's why...

23
00:03:04,950 --> 00:03:08,390
That's precisely why I was inspired by his ideal.

24
00:03:08,930 --> 00:03:10,610
Is that so wrong?

25
00:03:10,610 --> 00:03:14,400
Are these feelings fake just because they aren't my own?

26
00:03:14,740 --> 00:03:17,770
Should I not achieve that ideal, just because it's fake?

27
00:03:18,870 --> 00:03:20,110
No.

28
00:03:20,110 --> 00:03:22,480
I know that's not right.

29
00:03:22,480 --> 00:03:25,710
It doesn't matter if it's fake. Or an unattainable wish.

30
00:03:26,630 --> 00:03:29,310
I know that I can't save everyone.

31
00:03:29,310 --> 00:03:32,520
I know that no one can be saved without sacrifice!

32
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:37,950
Even knowing that it was nothing but an ideal,

33
00:03:37,950 --> 00:03:40,440
I only chased after it even harder.

34
00:03:42,860 --> 00:03:45,900
Even if I hurt one to save many,

35
00:03:45,900 --> 00:03:50,100
I'll keep pursuing a happy future where no one will be hurt.

36
00:03:56,950 --> 00:04:00,610
And this is where that ideal ultimately lead him.

37
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:07,610
A man once told me that what I believed in—
what I still believe in—was hypocrisy.

38
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:09,340
But in spite of that,

39
00:04:09,340 --> 00:04:14,090
the man who said those words 
stayed true to that same hypocrisy to the end.

40
00:04:14,640 --> 00:04:16,630
Which means that I can do it.

41
00:04:16,630 --> 00:04:20,130
Even if it's borrowed, even if it's fake, I don't care.

42
00:04:20,740 --> 00:04:22,620
I'm okay with that.

43
00:04:22,620 --> 00:04:26,630
Emiya Shirou can keep striving toward this dream!

44
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:31,390
Even if he doesn't find a single thing he was searching for!

45
00:04:34,260 --> 00:04:35,640
Come on...

46
00:04:36,410 --> 00:04:39,650
That's all there was to it?

47
00:04:41,280 --> 00:04:46,650
Though I may have held back, 
I'm sure you felt the blast of wind from Ea.

48
00:04:46,980 --> 00:04:49,470
If you have all those weapons,

49
00:04:49,470 --> 00:04:52,030
why would you hold back just one?

50
00:04:52,030 --> 00:04:55,200
Only the supreme ruler may wield that blade.

51
00:04:55,200 --> 00:05:00,040
You haven't the right to so much as look upon it.

52
00:05:09,470 --> 00:05:11,070
Saber...

53
00:05:11,070 --> 00:05:12,630
Are you unharmed, Shirou?

54
00:05:13,500 --> 00:05:15,430
I shall take over from here.

55
00:05:15,430 --> 00:05:19,690
No, you go help Tohsaka.

56
00:05:20,070 --> 00:05:23,190
I can handle Gilgamesh by myself.

57
00:05:24,300 --> 00:05:26,340
What are you saying, Shirou?

58
00:05:26,340 --> 00:05:29,180
A mage is no match for a Servant.

59
00:05:29,180 --> 00:05:32,910
Yeah, but he and I are exceptions to the rules.

60
00:05:33,420 --> 00:05:34,660
Trust me.

61
00:05:34,990 --> 00:05:37,660
I know I can beat this guy!

62
00:05:47,220 --> 00:05:48,720
Good luck.

63
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:51,240
I shall keep Rin safe.

64
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:52,260
Saber...

65
00:05:54,210 --> 00:05:58,560
I wasn't able to save you.

66
00:05:59,520 --> 00:06:03,150
I think that Grail isn't what you were hoping for.

67
00:06:03,670 --> 00:06:06,280
So take a good look.

68
00:06:06,280 --> 00:06:09,280
To make sure that you get it right next time.

69
00:06:09,830 --> 00:06:10,600
Shirou?

70
00:06:11,390 --> 00:06:14,290
Sorry, it's hard to explain.

71
00:06:14,290 --> 00:06:17,870
I guess I was never cut out to be your Master.

72
00:06:18,550 --> 00:06:19,620
So...

73
00:06:20,610 --> 00:06:21,960
That is untrue.

74
00:06:22,850 --> 00:06:25,130
You are my Master, Shirou.

75
00:06:26,880 --> 00:06:30,130
I shall go fulfill my duty as a Servant.

76
00:06:30,890 --> 00:06:33,260
Let us continue our discussion afterward.

77
00:06:51,860 --> 00:06:54,290
Are you mad, boy?

78
00:06:54,290 --> 00:06:58,870
You choose to be the sacrificial pawn, rather than use Saber?

79
00:06:58,870 --> 00:07:00,520
You fool.

80
00:07:00,520 --> 00:07:05,030
The act of self-sacrifice is naught but a lie.

81
00:07:05,030 --> 00:07:07,250
Being unable to see that, even now,

82
00:07:07,250 --> 00:07:10,100
marks you as an incorrigible hypocrite.

83
00:07:11,380 --> 00:07:14,010
A fraud and a hypocrite, huh?

84
00:07:14,010 --> 00:07:17,890
I guess. I am a fake through and through, after all.

85
00:07:18,890 --> 00:07:20,980
But I was mistaken all along.

86
00:07:20,980 --> 00:07:24,270
My sword-making doesn't actually create them.

87
00:07:24,740 --> 00:07:27,020
There's only one thing that I can do.

88
00:07:27,020 --> 00:07:31,280
And that's to give form to what's in my mind.

89
00:07:31,860 --> 00:07:34,040
I am the bone of my sword!

90
00:07:54,510 --> 00:07:58,680
My whole life was Unlimited Blade Works!

91
00:08:11,330 --> 00:08:14,430
That's right. I don't create swords.

92
00:08:14,430 --> 00:08:17,490
I create a world that contains an unlimited number of swords.

93
00:08:18,230 --> 00:08:21,990
That is the only magic allowed to Emiya Shirou.

94
00:08:22,620 --> 00:08:24,690
A Reality Marble, eh?

95
00:08:24,690 --> 00:08:26,140
What of it?

96
00:08:26,140 --> 00:08:29,000
What can you do with this wretched mental landscape?

97
00:08:33,090 --> 00:08:35,160
Don't be so surprised.

98
00:08:35,160 --> 00:08:37,640
Everything here is a fake.

99
00:08:37,640 --> 00:08:42,220
However, there's nothing that says a fake can't rival the real thing.

100
00:08:42,880 --> 00:08:45,410
If you say you're the genuine article,

101
00:08:45,410 --> 00:08:49,140
then I'll just surpass everything about you and take you down.

102
00:08:50,520 --> 00:08:52,610
Aqui vou eu, Rei dos Heróis.

103
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:55,860
Você tem armas suficientes em estoque?

104
00:08:57,540 --> 00:09:00,490
Você se acha importante demais, seu mestiço.

105
00:09:02,310 --> 00:09:03,990
What in the world is that?

106
00:09:04,780 --> 00:09:09,100
Can being summoned incorrectly change a Servant so drastically?

107
00:09:11,750 --> 00:09:12,380
Rin!

108
00:09:12,740 --> 00:09:15,260
Where are you, Rin?

109
00:09:16,300 --> 00:09:17,260
Saber?

110
00:09:18,450 --> 00:09:19,220
Rin!

111
00:09:19,220 --> 00:09:20,050
No, Saber!

112
00:09:21,830 --> 00:09:22,680
But...

113
00:09:23,030 --> 00:09:24,580
Trust me. Just don't.

114
00:09:24,580 --> 00:09:27,110
This muck is similar to a Servant in nature.

115
00:09:27,110 --> 00:09:29,520
If you touched it, there's no telling what would happen.

116
00:09:30,760 --> 00:09:32,200
I understand.

117
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:34,650
Then hurry to this side, Rin.

118
00:09:34,650 --> 00:09:38,230
As long as you can get clear, I shall see to the rest.

119
00:09:38,230 --> 00:09:41,610
Yeah. Okay, I'll leave it to you.

120
00:09:41,610 --> 00:09:45,040
But if I don't get there in time, do what has to be done.

121
00:09:45,750 --> 00:09:46,950
I cannot, Rin!

122
00:09:46,950 --> 00:09:49,830
If that is the alternative, I shall rescue you now!

123
00:09:50,280 --> 00:09:51,830
These curses are...

124
00:09:53,850 --> 00:09:55,860
Rin! You used a Command Spell?

125
00:09:55,860 --> 00:09:57,450
Of course I did.

126
00:09:57,450 --> 00:10:02,590
I can't let the one person who can 
destroy the Grail throw her life away.

127
00:10:03,100 --> 00:10:05,740
Besides, you don't need to worry about me.

128
00:10:05,740 --> 00:10:08,640
I can get out of this, no problem.

129
00:10:08,640 --> 00:10:14,080
So don't worry about that. 
Just believe in me and ready your holy sword.

130
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:14,800
Rin...

131
00:10:15,270 --> 00:10:16,650
If only.

132
00:10:17,270 --> 00:10:20,400
This is definitely easier said than done.

133
00:10:20,400 --> 00:10:24,440
I wonder if this thing would let me go if I returned Shinji.

134
00:10:28,270 --> 00:10:29,250
What's happening?

135
00:10:29,770 --> 00:10:30,870
That's...

136
00:10:32,710 --> 00:10:33,540
Rin!

137
00:10:51,500 --> 00:10:52,890
Oh, no.

138
00:11:17,750 --> 00:11:20,330
Por que as lâminas desse vira-lata estão me encurralando?

139
00:11:20,330 --> 00:11:22,010
Don't you get it?

140
00:11:22,340 --> 00:11:25,140
You may be ranked the highest of all Heroic Spirits

141
00:11:25,140 --> 00:11:28,740
because you possess over a thousand Noble Phantasms.

142
00:11:28,740 --> 00:11:32,600
But you're a king, not a warrior.

143
00:11:32,940 --> 00:11:37,110
You didn't choose the path of mastering a single Noble Phantasm.

144
00:11:37,370 --> 00:11:39,940
You're like me: jack of all trades, master of none!

145
00:11:41,120 --> 00:11:46,330
Quando eu terminar com você, não sobrará um único estilhaço de osso do seu crânio falsificador!

146
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:55,710
This is the pits.

147
00:11:55,710 --> 00:11:58,850
I can't even tell which way to go to get out of here.

148
00:12:02,390 --> 00:12:06,470
That jerk sure is using up my mana.

149
00:12:11,550 --> 00:12:13,720
This is it, I guess.

150
00:12:13,720 --> 00:12:16,900
But I won't let it end like this.

151
00:12:16,900 --> 00:12:18,730
By my Command Spell, I order you:

152
00:12:18,730 --> 00:12:21,730
Saber, destroy the Holy Grail right now!

153
00:12:24,190 --> 00:12:26,320
What? Impossible!

154
00:12:26,670 --> 00:12:28,820
Rin! Get out of there!

155
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:31,040
Sorry, Saber.

156
00:12:31,040 --> 00:12:34,600
You probably wouldn't do it if I just asked you, so I have to force you.

157
00:12:35,500 --> 00:12:38,580
And I guess I should apologize to you too.

158
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:43,510
Sorry I couldn't save you, Shinji.

159
00:12:44,310 --> 00:12:47,220
Your pathetic whining offends me.

160
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:07,510
Now go, Rin.

161
00:13:16,370 --> 00:13:17,910
Hurry, Rin!

162
00:13:28,330 --> 00:13:29,430
Saber!

163
00:13:29,780 --> 00:13:32,850
I'm feeding you the last of my mana!

164
00:13:33,220 --> 00:13:35,850
So take that Holy Grail

165
00:13:36,270 --> 00:13:37,970
and blast it so hard

166
00:13:38,600 --> 00:13:40,650
there won't be a single trace left!

167
00:13:56,930 --> 00:13:58,290
Ex...

168
00:14:02,130 --> 00:14:03,880
calibur!

169
00:14:43,430 --> 00:14:45,040
Wow...

170
00:14:49,050 --> 00:14:50,760
Our contract is concluded.

171
00:14:51,650 --> 00:14:53,990
Victory is yours, Rin.

172
00:14:54,990 --> 00:14:58,780
Were it allowed, I would have liked to have remained to the end

173
00:14:58,780 --> 00:15:01,060
to see what becomes of you two.

174
00:15:01,730 --> 00:15:05,050
However, that is not my role.

175
00:15:06,120 --> 00:15:09,140
After all, Shirou has you, Rin.

176
00:15:31,020 --> 00:15:32,340
Impossible!

177
00:15:32,340 --> 00:15:34,100
I'm being forced back?

178
00:15:34,100 --> 00:15:36,180
By a fraud like you?

179
00:15:36,180 --> 00:15:38,620
Against any other Servant,

180
00:15:38,620 --> 00:15:41,930
creating a world like this wouldn't let me hold my own.

181
00:15:41,930 --> 00:15:44,200
Having an unlimited number of swords

182
00:15:44,200 --> 00:15:47,440
wouldn't let me stand up to a Servant who had mastered one!

183
00:15:47,440 --> 00:15:49,520
But against you,

184
00:15:49,520 --> 00:15:52,320
my swords are ready and waiting,

185
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:54,570
so I'm always one step ahead!

186
00:15:55,590 --> 00:15:57,070
D-Damn you...

187
00:15:57,740 --> 00:15:58,820
Damn you!

188
00:15:58,820 --> 00:16:00,060
Damn you! Damn you!

189
00:16:00,060 --> 00:16:01,040
Damn you!

190
00:16:06,260 --> 00:16:07,460
Damn you!

191
00:16:07,460 --> 00:16:11,710
To think that I must go all-out against the likes of you!

192
00:16:49,220 --> 00:16:51,000
Rho Aias.

193
00:17:13,900 --> 00:17:15,400
I shall grant you this:

194
00:17:15,780 --> 00:17:18,910
at this moment, you are powerful!

195
00:17:19,660 --> 00:17:22,660
You're not getting away!

196
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:56,790
You ran out of mana? How anticlimactic.

197
00:17:57,530 --> 00:17:59,530
Victory is yours.

198
00:17:59,530 --> 00:18:02,990
Morra com essa satisfação, seu impostor.

199
00:18:11,750 --> 00:18:12,710
What?

200
00:18:13,790 --> 00:18:16,340
Swallowing me accomplishes nothing...

201
00:18:18,290 --> 00:18:18,920
Wait!

202
00:18:19,490 --> 00:18:21,910
The Holy Grail's hole?

203
00:18:25,970 --> 00:18:27,810
That malformed abomination!

204
00:18:28,420 --> 00:18:32,480
Does it not know that a fellow Servant cannot be made its core?

205
00:18:32,480 --> 00:18:33,880
Damn...

206
00:18:33,880 --> 00:18:35,820
You're trying to take me down with you?

207
00:18:35,820 --> 00:18:37,170
Fool!

208
00:18:37,170 --> 00:18:39,650
I haven't the least intention of dying!

209
00:18:39,650 --> 00:18:41,780
Plant your heels, ruffian!

210
00:18:41,780 --> 00:18:44,240
At least until I climb back to where you are!

211
00:18:47,600 --> 00:18:48,830
As if!

212
00:18:49,380 --> 00:18:52,750
I'll rip off my own arm if that's what it takes!

213
00:18:54,850 --> 00:18:58,250
Do so if you wish, but step to the right first.

214
00:18:59,760 --> 00:19:00,840
You—

215
00:19:02,810 --> 00:19:06,410
Ar... cher...

216
00:19:22,770 --> 00:19:24,110
That guy...

217
00:19:24,650 --> 00:19:26,730
Always showing off.

218
00:19:36,750 --> 00:19:37,920
Archer!

219
00:19:47,330 --> 00:19:48,320
Archer...

220
00:19:50,770 --> 00:19:52,310
It's unfortunate,

221
00:19:52,950 --> 00:19:54,650
but there you have it.

222
00:19:54,650 --> 00:19:57,520
Give up on the Grail this time, Rin.

223
00:20:04,210 --> 00:20:05,650
What's with that?

224
00:20:05,650 --> 00:20:08,680
This is hardly the time to be laughing!

225
00:20:08,680 --> 00:20:10,080
My apologies.

226
00:20:10,080 --> 00:20:13,610
I couldn't help it, given your state.

227
00:20:13,610 --> 00:20:18,040
I was amused that you and I cut such sorry figures.

228
00:20:20,230 --> 00:20:24,050
Archer... Will you make a contract with me again?

229
00:20:26,490 --> 00:20:28,480
I can't do that.

230
00:20:28,480 --> 00:20:30,810
I doubt I have that right.

231
00:20:30,810 --> 00:20:34,180
Besides, I no longer have a goal.

232
00:20:34,710 --> 00:20:38,080
My battle ends here.

233
00:20:38,080 --> 00:20:40,840
But... But this means you'll...

234
00:20:40,840 --> 00:20:44,440
No matter how much time passes, you'll never be saved.

235
00:20:47,120 --> 00:20:48,700
Oh, man.

236
00:20:49,710 --> 00:20:50,830
Rin.

237
00:20:52,050 --> 00:20:53,960
Look after me.

238
00:20:53,960 --> 00:20:56,940
As you know, I'm a bit hopeless.

239
00:20:56,940 --> 00:20:59,580
Give me a shoulder to lean on.

240
00:21:00,290 --> 00:21:01,540
Archer...

241
00:21:03,440 --> 00:21:05,570
Yeah, I know.

242
00:21:06,390 --> 00:21:08,340
I'll do my best.

243
00:21:08,340 --> 00:21:12,460
I'll try my hardest to make sure 
he doesn't end up a twisted jerk like you.

244
00:21:12,460 --> 00:21:16,350
I'll make sure he learns to love himself!

245
00:21:16,350 --> 00:21:18,140
So you hang in there too!

246
00:21:19,560 --> 00:21:21,040
I have my answer.

247
00:21:22,160 --> 00:21:24,360
Don't worry, Tohsaka.

248
00:21:25,220 --> 00:21:28,300
I'll try my hardest from now on, too.

249
00:21:40,110 --> 00:21:44,310
Damn, I didn't even get the chance to tear him a new one.

250
00:21:50,450 --> 00:21:52,930
Let's go home, Tohsaka.

251
00:07:34,780 --> 00:07:37,780
Steel is my body and fire is my blood

252
00:07:38,400 --> 00:07:40,790
I have created over a thousand blades

253
00:07:41,200 --> 00:07:43,040
Unaware of Loss,

254
00:07:43,230 --> 00:07:45,170
nor aware of Gain

255
00:07:45,770 --> 00:07:47,670
Withstood pain to create weapons,

256
00:07:48,100 --> 00:07:50,420
waiting for one’s arrival

257
00:07:50,810 --> 00:07:54,170
I have no regrets. This is the only path

